PROJECT: The Vault

THERE IS A Text called "Status" with value "Locked".
THERE IS A Text called "PinCode" with value "1234".
THERE IS A Text called "UserGuess" with value "".
THERE IS A Number called "GoldBars" with value 0.

WHEN "Login" is triggered:
  - ASK "Enter the 4-digit PIN:" and STORE in "UserGuess".
  - IF "UserGuess" IS "PinCode":
      - OUTPUT "Access Granted."
      - REPEAT 3 TIMES:
          - SET "GoldBars" to "GoldBars" PLUS 1.
          - OUTPUT "Dispensing Gold Bar..."
      - OUTPUT "Total Gold Dispensed:".
      - OUTPUT "GoldBars".
  - IF "UserGuess" IS NOT "PinCode":
      - OUTPUT "Access Denied. Security Alert Triggered."

CONSTRAINT:
  - "GoldBars" cannot be greater than 10.
